      "already_pushed": true,
      "text": "Yes, I'm convinced it'll create another nomad wave around 2028\n\nMany offices will be a thing of the past (again!) as people will just be prompting from everywhere\n\nAdd to that self driving vehicles (and vans/RVs) and you get many perpetually people moving around again https://t.co/EKL2IfpDnF",
      "text_zh": "是的，我确信这会在 2028 年左右再掀起一波数字游民浪潮\n\n很多办公室又会成为过去式（再一次！），因为人们可以在任何地方做 prompting\n\n再加上自动驾驶汽车（以及厢式车/房车），你会再次看到很多人处于持续移动的状态 https://t.co/EKL2IfpDnF",
      "hit": false,
      "quoted": [
        {
          "id": "2124853422675440077",
          "user": "scottastevenson",
          "text": "I’m legitimately starting to wonder: would today be more productive if I was prompting agents from the gym, or a hiking trail, rather than from a desk?\n\nThe great unshackling of knowledge workers might be a beautiful thing.",
          "text_zh": "我是认真开始在想：如果我今天是在健身房或徒步小路上给 agents 下指令，而不是坐在书桌前，会不会更有效率？\n\n知识工作者的大解放，也许会是一件很美的事。"
        }
      ]
